OL,3,ANepal calls for 'global effort' to
OL,4,Aaddress climate change after
OL,5,Adevastating flash floods
OL,6,
OL,7,FNepal's foreign minister is calling for
OL,8,Fa "global effort" to tackle climate
OL,9,Fchange, saying his country is among the
OL,10,Fworst-hit by rising temperatures
OL,12,FHis comments come as at least 675
OL,13,Fpeople have died and more than 2,400
OL,14,Fpeople are missing following
OL,15,Fdevastating flash floods on the
OL,16,FNepal-Tibet border on Wednesday
OL,18,FIt is thought that a glacier collapse
OL,19,Fsparked the devastating floods, which
OL,20,Fone one aid worker compared to a
OL,21,F"tsunami"
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
